<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT - Domtar upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Domtar upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it raised its recommendation on Domtar Inc to trading buy from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- New York Stock Exchange-listed shares were up 1/8 to 7-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
